translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_b283d17d:

    # "You step on the wire right on the floor, making a loud chime sound from the device."
    "装置顿时发出响亮的钟声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_c1c10e9b:

    # bd "Ha, caught cha sneaking right here!"
    bd "哈，逮着你在这儿偷偷摸摸的了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_70506bfb:

    # "You work on the tripwire, disabling it from making any loud noise."
    "你动手处理绊线，令它无法再发出任何响声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_40981576:

    # bd "Fella, what cha doing here? Go guard outside or raid a house with the rest of us."
    bd "伙计，你在这儿干什么？出去守卫，或者和我们一起去抢劫民宅。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_743752d2:

    # e "A-aye!"
    e "是、是！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_c1c10e9b_1:

    # bd "Ha, caught cha sneaking right here!"
    bd "哈，逮着你在这儿偷偷摸摸的了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_bf1e9928:

    # "You take a look at the mirror, it is too foggy for you to see your own image."
    "你照了照镜子，雾气太重，根本看不清自己的模样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_6250e604:

    # "Searching around the dresser, you found a dusty piece of clothing."
    "你在梳妆台周围搜寻，找到了一件积满灰尘的衣物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_6a1c47a6:

    # "It's only after patting away some of the dust, you discovered that it's a pair of colourful pants, something that a famous bard may wear..."
    "你拍掉一些灰尘后才发现，那是一条色彩鲜艳的裤子，像是某位著名吟游诗人会穿的那种……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_6e2114f6:

    # "Without a second thought, you put the piece of garment into your bag."
    "你想都没想，就把这件衣物塞进了包里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_9c1d415c:

    # "Searching around the dresser leaves nothing important. Only a few rusty coins here and there."
    "在梳妆台周围搜寻没发现什么重要的东西，只有零零散散的几枚生锈硬币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_c7db288d:

    # "With a few old notes, coming from the bandit's gibberish."
    "还有几张写满强盗胡言乱语的旧字条。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_4c2376e9:

    # "You take a gander around the bookshelf, it's all old books with a wide variety of colours."
    "你扫了一眼书架，上面全是颜色各异的旧书。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_cfd2ad74:

    # "Doesn't seem it's been used at all."
    "看起来完全没人用过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_698e1e57:

    # "You open the cabinet, it seems to be mostly empty. Some of them can't even be opened properly."
    "你打开柜子，里面似乎几乎是空的。有些甚至没法正常打开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_5eac75cd:

    # "There were a little food, some treasures and shiny loot scattered across the table."
    "桌上散落着一点食物、一些宝物和闪闪发亮的战利品。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_ce836cf2:

    # "Books, and some pen and pencils can be seen on this table, but there's no chair. Do the bandits never sit down?"
    "桌上能看到书，还有几支钢笔和铅笔，但没有椅子。难道这些强盗从来不坐下吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_ac4dffcc:

    # "You stare at the empty bed, it seems to be owned by a rather hefty man, with the way these frames bend down."
    "你盯着那张空床，从床架弯曲下陷的程度来看，它的主人似乎是个相当魁梧的男人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_d4c547b3:

    # "The worst is, you can still smell the heavy sweaty scent, one that is rather fishy..."
    "更糟的是，你还能闻到浓重的汗臭味，其中还夹着一股相当诡异的鱼腥味……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_8048e087:

    # "You see the bandit boss sitting on the bed casually, loudly munching on the apple or plum on his hand."
    "你看到强盗头目若无其事地坐在床上，大声啃着手里的苹果或李子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_ab47fb71:

    # sbd "What are you looking at?"
    sbd "你在看什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_7a43849b:

    # sbd "Get back to work, or bring me my plums. We need some more gold otherwise."
    sbd "回去干活，或者把我的李子带来。否则我们还得再弄些金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_ab47fb71_1:

    # sbd "What are you looking at?"
    sbd "你在看什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_209707be:

    # e "Uh..."
    e "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_308c1da6:

    # sbd "Ugh, I remembered you, you should be out of training by now, where's your hood?"
    sbd "啧，我记得你。你现在应该已经结束训练了吧，兜帽呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_494548f0:

    # e "Hood? I didn't get a hood, boss."
    e "兜帽？我没拿到兜帽，老大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_641ffa31:

    # sbd "Fine."
    sbd "行了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_ca1000ec:

    # sbd "Hey! Come here."
    sbd "嘿！过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_99e85742:

    # bd "What's it, boss?"
    bd "怎么了，老大？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_c403a4d0:

    # sbd "How did the newcomer not get a hood?"
    sbd "新来的怎么会没拿到兜帽？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_e15d1aeb:

    # bd "Wait, did we not just banged his as-"
    bd "等等，我们不是刚刚操过他的屁——"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_f2084440:

    # bd "I think we must have mistaken something..."
    bd "我觉得我们肯定是搞错了什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_15f4af97:

    # sbd "What?"
    sbd "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_f2de0556:

    # bd "I'll get him a hood, sorry boss."
    bd "我这就给他拿顶兜帽，对不起，老大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_bbff2cc1:

    # bd "Uh newcomer? I've never seen him before"
    bd "呃，新来的？我以前从没见过他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_c2054931:

    # sbd "I don't want to hear any excuses, now get him a hood."
    sbd "我不想听任何借口，现在去给他拿顶兜帽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_965b39ae:

    # bd "Y-yes, boss."
    bd "是、是的，老大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_5f4462c8:

    # "The bandit quickly grabs a hood and brings it to you."
    "那个强盗迅速拿来一顶兜帽，送到你面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_b1b76aab:

    # bd "Well, put it on if you don't want us to mistake you as an adventurer."
    bd "戴上吧，要是不想让我们把你错认成冒险者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_ab47fb71_2:

    # sbd "What are you looking at?"
    sbd "你在看什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_7a43849b_1:

    # sbd "Get back to work, or bring me my plums. We need some more gold otherwise."
    sbd "回去干活，或者把我的李子拿来。否则我们还需要更多金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_ab47fb71_3:

    # sbd "What are you looking at?"
    sbd "你在看什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_2035b78b:

    # sbd "And where's your hood? Didn't we just gave you one?"
    sbd "你的兜帽呢？我们不是刚给了你一顶吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_4d69c576:

    # sbd "Hey! Who the fuck are you?"
    sbd "喂！你他妈到底是谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_7ad5c623:

    # e "I- I was just walking by..."
    e "我、我只是路过……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_1383db54:

    # sbd "How dare you walking up to me like nothing happened."
    sbd "你竟敢像什么都没发生过一样走到我面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_c33fa1ce:

    # sbd "Ugh... pesky adventurer. My men will catch you one way or the other. Start running now."
    sbd "啧……烦人的冒险者。我的手下迟早会抓住你。现在开始跑吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_f97ba34f:

    # e "Are you... not going to do anything?"
    e "你……不打算做点什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_98a56686:

    # sbd "Trust me, you don't want me to be the one catching you, adventurer. Now let me finish my plum in peace."
    sbd "相信我，你不会想让我亲自抓住你的，冒险者。现在让我安安静静地吃完我的李子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_2776c93e:

    # "You open the chest, it contains a few stolen goods, there's no prose inside, but you found an accounting journal..."
    "你打开箱子，里面有几件赃物，没有散文，但你找到了一本账簿……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_a8422e59:

    # "You flip over the pages, and something caught your eyes in one page."
    "你翻过几页，其中一页上的某样东西吸引了你的目光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_967cb17b:

    # "It reads... that the bandit stole the prose from the bard?"
    "上面写着……那个强盗从吟游诗人那里偷走了散文？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_3b4887e3:

    # "And in the next day, they sold it to someone in the village, you wonder what that means."
    "第二天，他们把它卖给了村里的某个人，你不禁疑惑这意味着什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_eaa9cdb3:

    # "But regardless, it's not in the bandit's hand anymore, you should probably just go back to Pirkka and ask what he should do next."
    "不过不管怎样，那东西已经不在强盗手里了。你最好回去找皮尔卡，问问他接下来该怎么办。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandits_Hideout_Loop_e7eb5f02:

    # "The chest has been opened, but you intend to check the journal again."
    "箱子已经打开了，但你打算再查看一次账簿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_5053bac3:

    # "A bandit exclaims when he catches you."
    "一名强盗逮到你时惊叫起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_bb929b3b:

    # "You have to do something right now, else the other bandits are just going to come here..."
    "你得马上做点什么，不然其他强盗就要过来了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_ca948673:

    # "You try to slip away from the bandit."
    "你试图悄悄从强盗身边溜走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_d0da3a4e:

    # bd "This is our territory, boy. You're not getting away with this."
    bd "这里是我们的地盘，小子。你别想就这么逃掉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_4ede6b52:

    # "You barely escape from the masked man's grasp."
    "你勉强挣脱了蒙面人的掌控。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_db1f1132:

    # bd "H-hey! Come back here."
    bd "喂、喂！给我回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_0a641705:

    # "Not listening to him, you sprint quickly towards the exit of the fortress."
    "你没理会他，飞快地朝堡垒出口冲去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_b0d527e0:

    # "And finally, you arrive to a safer place with all your energy exhausted."
    "最后，你终于抵达了一个更安全的地方，却已经耗尽了全部精力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_5af3f3f5:

    # "Suddenly, the bandit grips your tail easily."
    "突然，强盗轻易地一把抓住了你的尾巴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_8de9c05d:

    # e "F-fuck!"
    e "妈、妈的！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_8d5c964b:

    # "You fall face first on the floor, dragged towards the bandit, who's laughing hysterically."
    "你脸朝下摔在地上，被拖向那个狂笑不止的强盗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_e4a0d58a:

    # bd "Hah, what a dumbass, come back here, won't ya."
    bd "哈，真是个蠢货。回来吧，好不好？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_02a0efaf:

    # e "Alright, I give up. Please just take my coins."
    e "好吧，我放弃了。求你了，把我的金币拿走吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_ae1a6854:

    # "The bandit smirks, he drags you towards him, checking you out with a sinister look."
    "强盗咧嘴一笑，把你拖向自己，用阴险的目光上下打量着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_bf39400a:

    # bd "Well, at least you're smart knowing you can't escape from us."
    bd "哼，至少你还算聪明，知道自己逃不出我们的手掌心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_0534db65:

    # "For some reason, the bandits releases you from their camp, perhaps they still have a little conscience towards someone... as {i}pure{/i} as you."
    "不知出于什么原因，强盗们把你放出了他们的营地。也许，他们对像你这样{i}纯洁{/i}的人还存有一丝良知……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_4550fc3c:

    # "And when you wake up from the darkness, you're already out of the bandit's hideouts."
    "当你从黑暗中醒来时，已经离开了强盗的藏身处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_b92c892c:

    # "Apparently they've decided to let you go, you are so wasted from these few hours serving those bandits."
    "看来他们决定放你走了。仅仅服侍那些强盗几个小时，就已经让你疲惫不堪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_05090e87:

    # "You can't imagine what a lifetime of being used for pleasure would feel like, not that you'd want to know."
    "你无法想象，一辈子被当作取乐工具会是什么感觉——当然，你也不想知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_eb705bbd:

    # "But at least, you're spared of your freedom, for now."
    "但至少，你暂时保住了自由。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bandit_Encounter_Bandit_c8742c33:

    # "You lost [lost_gold] gold."
    "你损失了[lost_gold]枚金币。"
